  "implementation_note": "Sales Invoice and Purchase Invoice remain the financial recognition documents. Sales Return and Purchase Return are the only commercial return DocTypes. VeloraERP v0.14.0 adds FIFO, perpetual Moving Average and periodic Weighted Average valuation, Opening Stock Entry, Stock Revaluation and approved Inventory Valuation Closing. Weighted Average issues are provisionally costed during the period and reconciled to the final period average at close. Stock Ledger Records remain append-only and authoritative. VeloraERP v0.15.0 adds Inventory Item cost-based selling prices, Customer Group margin inheritance, server-enforced below-cost controls on Sales Order and Sales Invoice, actual issue-cost validation on Delivery Note, last-purchase-cost snapshots including landed costs, and stock-UOM conversion through inventory movements.",
